},
```

Also add a hydration effect: when the store rehydrates from localStorage, call `audioEngine.setMasterVolume(get().masterVolume)` so the stored value takes effect. This can be done via Zustand's `onRehydrateStorage` callback:

```typescript
persist(
  (set, get) => ({ ... }),
