- `/Users/chiu.fyi/work/drum-practice/src/app/live/page.tsx` - Main orchestration page where all features converge: metronome UI, drill timer, auto-stop, and bar recording with BPM
- `/Users/chiu.fyi/work/drum-practice/src/components/live/LiveResultsModal.tsx` - Results display where feedback messages and tempo floor analysis are shown to the user

